msgctxt "180"
msgid "What's wrong, kid?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid ""
"I really, really, <Italic>really</Italic> need some goya juice... And it "
"has to be from here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Any reason it has to be from this shop in particular?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Um, well... My mom got really sick and ended up in the\r\n"
"hospital, so... I just wanted her to get better."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"I heard people say that if you drink the goya juice from this shop, it'll "
"cure any sickness you have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"The kids in my class say it's all a lie, but... even so,\r\n"
"I still wanna get some for my mom. All I care about is\r\n"
"seeing her healthy again..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "I see... So you're just doing what you can, huh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"This place has been closed down for a while, kid. Why don't I just buy you "
"some juice from another shop?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"But that won't work! It has to be goya juice from this shop alone. Or else "
"my mom won't get any better..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "(This kid's got a big heart, that's for sure...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"Okay, I'll tell you what. Let's look around for the\r\n"
"shopkeeper together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Okay! Thank you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Excuse me! Anybody in there!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Helloooo!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"My goodness, what's with all the racket? We've been closed fer years, "
"y'know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"Did you used to run this place, ma'am? Sorry to bother you, but could you "
"make this kid a glass of your special goya juice?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "So that's what y'all came for... Hrm... I don't know..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"His mother is hospitalized with some kind of illness, and all she needs is "
"a little bit of juice to help her get back to normal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "Please make some for my mom! I just know it'll make her better!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"Well, if ya put it that way, how can I say no? But y'gotta\r\n"
"bring me the right ingredients."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid ""
"I'll need some <Color:7>goya<Color:Default>, "
"<Color:7>kuruzata<Color:Default>, <Color:7>basanai<Color:Default>, "
"<Color:7>dugwai<Color:Default>, and <Color:7>lemon<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "Some... what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid ""
"You hard of hearin', young man? I need five ingredients: goya, kuruzata, "
"basanai, dugwai, and lemon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"I can use ingredients similar to those, too, if y'manage\r\n"
"to scrounge up something better. But that can get awful\r\n"
"pricey."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid ""
"I think she was using Okinawan words. I used to hear my grandpa talk like "
"that every now and then..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid ""
"\"Goya\" means \"bitter melon,\" but I don't know any of those\r\n"
"other things she said."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"The <Color:7>Public Market<Color:Default> has a shop that sells healthy "
"stuff.\r\n"
"I bet you can find everything there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"(Well... Might as well head to the <Color:7>Public Market<Color:Default> "
"and see what I can find.)"
msgstr ""

